            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Mwanadamu, Nebukadneza mfalme wa Babeli aliongoza jeshi lake kufanya kazi ngumu dhidi ya Tiro; kila kichwa kilipata upaa na kila bega likachunika. Lakini yeye na jeshi lake hawakupata malipo yoyote kutokana na muda wote aliongoza hiyo vita dhidi ya Tiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo hili ndilo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.29.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi asemalo: Nitaitia Misri mikononi mwa Nebukadneza mfalme wa Babeli, naye atachukua utajiri wa Misri. Atateka mateka na kuchukua nyara mali za Misri kama ujira kwa ajili ya jeshi lake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimempa mfalme wa Babeli nchi ya Misri kuwa ujira kwa juhudi zake kwa sababu yeye na jeshi lake walifanya kwa ajili yangu, asema",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
